WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
Back in the old days, they never looked at the&nbsp;
economy as something that they needed to pay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.160
attention to. Like every day we're looking at the&nbsp;
economy. Is it going up? Are we in a recession,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:13.020
is it going down? In the old days, they didn't&nbsp;
have to do that because it was just like you and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:19.260
your farm and the weather and like, hopefully&nbsp;
it all went well. But now we are all connected.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:26.220
Like what happens on the other side of the world&nbsp;
affects you and me. Like we are all connected. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:32.820
that's really cool because it means we're all like&nbsp;
organized and we can work together to make better&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:39.060
stuff and everyone prospers. But what it also&nbsp;
means is that your destiny is actually determined&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:47.040
by like a bunch of other people's feelings about&nbsp;
whether things are looking good or bad. And that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:53.760
kind of nuts. That's why these mysterious economic&nbsp;
cycles happen is because no one's really in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:58.200
control. It's just all of us trying to coordinate.&nbsp;
Sometimes it goes well, sometimes it doesn't.

